<title>PERU: Peru's Edelnor announces cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Peru's Edelnor announces cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian electricty distributor Edelnor announced Monday a cash didvidend of 0.0357 soles per share to shareholders registered by May 5, the Lima Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The payout date for the dividend, which will total 27.4 million soles, is May 12.</p>
<p>Edelnor is controlled by the Distrilima consortium composed of Spain's Endesa and Chilean companies Enersis  and Chilectra</p>
<p>((-- Eduardo Orozco, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
